  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Russia MWWP IIP 4 towns - consulting services</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ryssland VB IIP 4 st&#xe4;der</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I de fyra st&#xe4;derna Oryol, Pskov, Vologda och Volchov, som tillsammans har ca 1 miljon inv&#xe5;nare har ett investeringsprogram p&#xe5;b&#xf6;rjats f&#xf6;r attf&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra vattenf&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjning och avloppshantering.Sida st&#xf6;der projektetgenom konsultinsatser. Investeringar h&#xe4;r samt i ytterligare 10 st&#xe4;der kommer att finansieras med st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n V&#xe4;rldsbanken.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the four cities of Oryol, Pskov, Vologda and Volchov (together 1 million inhabitants) is an investment programme being implemented. The aim is to improve water supply and waste water management. Sida isfinancing detailed designs. Investments in these cities and in anothercities will be financed with support from the World Bank.</narrative>
  </description>
